	<item>
		<title>
		Comment on &#8220;I owe nearly everything I&#8217;ve learned here to him&#8221; by Betsy Mudama		</title>
		<link>http://www.ericdanforthmudama.org/?p=88#comment-26</link>

		<dc:creator><![CDATA[Betsy Mudama]]></dc:creator>
		<pubDate>Wed, 11 Apr 2018 03:08:58 +0000</pubDate>
		<guid isPermaLink="false">http://52.42.184.240/?p=88#comment-26</guid>

					<description><![CDATA[Thank you so much for your loving words about our wonderful son Eric.  We are so very happy that he inspired you, and we&#039;re thankful that his encouragement will help you to carry on the work that he loved so much.
Several years ago, after he had started his flying lessons, he told me that, had he taken the lessons when he was a teenager, he would have become a pilot instead of an engineer.  He loved flying so much, and I truly picture his soul flying so very freely in the universe.  His spirit will always be with us.
Betsy Mudama]]></description>
			<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>Thank you so much for your loving words about our wonderful son Eric.  We are so very happy that he inspired you, and we&#8217;re thankful that his encouragement will help you to carry on the work that he loved so much.<br />
Several years ago, after he had started his flying lessons, he told me that, had he taken the lessons when he was a teenager, he would have become a pilot instead of an engineer.  He loved flying so much, and I truly picture his soul flying so very freely in the universe.  His spirit will always be with us.<br />
Betsy Mudama</p>
]]></content:encoded>
		
			</item>
