					<description><![CDATA[Eric and Sarah at Nauset Beach in Orleans, MA, of August 1986 or 87.
They were both such natural water bugs!  
(I always had them wear t-shirts when we went to Nauset so that I could spot them out there in the waves and, hopefully, prevent bad sunburns.)  They never wanted to get out of the water.]]></description>
			<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>Eric and Sarah at Nauset Beach in Orleans, MA, of August 1986 or 87.<br />
They were both such natural water bugs!<br />
(I always had them wear t-shirts when we went to Nauset so that I could spot them out there in the waves and, hopefully, prevent bad sunburns.)  They never wanted to get out of the water.</p>
]]></content:encoded>
		
